IMPORTANT NOTE:

As of May 1, 1994 the REND386 package is no longer being actively supported.
The authors of REND386 have each gone on to create better rendering engines.

For information about AVRIL (a completely rewritten, easier-to-use and
more portable renderer), contact Bernie Roehl (broehl@uwaterloo.ca).
The AVRIL distribution can be found on sunee.uwaterloo.ca in the pub/avril
directory; get the read.me file first for more information.

For information about VR-386 (a modified and somewhat cleaned-up version
of REND386) contact Dave Stampe (dstampe@psych.utoronto.ca).

You're welcome to download any of the files in this directory, but you'd
almost certainly be better off using AVRIL or VR-386.

